<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates remain unchanged, seen stable.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates remain unchanged, seen stable.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan cotton yarn rates remained unchanged on Monday and are likely to remain stable because of steady conditions in the domestic cotton market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for a 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>				     Monday	 Previous</p>
<p>    Al-Karam (A.K.)	    480	    480</p>
<p>    Popular (Shabaz)	   465	    465</p>
<p>    Din Tex.		     475	    475</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Amir Zia 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
